cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the associated manuscript; see CITATION.md."
type: software
title: "MDDIPIC MATLAB paper code"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23907616
date-released: 2026-11-03
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementations of MDDIPIC and DRAP for multi-antenna OTFS sensing
  and channel estimation, with DDAFR, MDDAFR, OMP and NOMP baselines.
  Includes a reproducible small-scale sensing and communication demonstration,
  model-order stopping comparisons, computational ablations, LMMSE equalization,
  and numerical checks. MATLAB, Communications Toolbox and Phased Array System
  Toolbox are required.
authors:
